    "summary": "The user engages the assistant in a nuanced debate regarding the tension between national security/stability and the right to internet access. The assistant provides a balanced overview of the competing interests, acknowledging the necessity of state intervention in emergencies while emphasizing the legal and ethical importance of proportionality and oversight.",
